    "rationale": "The shield is the only container whose silhouette no project, repository or app icon shares, and it carries the chief idea without a word. Disc, ring, rosette and tile are all built on the option page beside it; brackets keep the mark largest. Tile and gauge arc stay on the board: the tile reads as an app icon, and the open arc loses its shape at 16 px.",
